OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies in motorcycle crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA 16-year-old boy has died in a crash
OL,6,Fbetween a motorcycle and car.
OL,8,FAt about 18:40 BST on Monday, officers
OL,9,Ffrom Northumbria Police were called to
OL,10,Fa two-vehicle collision on the A196
OL,11,Fnear Stobhill in Morpeth,
OL,12,FNorthumberland, the force said.
OL,14,FA black Yamaha motorcycle and grey
OL,15,FVolkswagen Polo had both been
OL,16,Ftravelling in the north-easterly
OL,17,Fdirection when they collided opposite
OL,18,Fthe junction of Bowyer Way. The
OL,19,Fteenager died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
